          <div class="text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.15em] text-[var(--dim)]">46 · Anti-fee-sniping</div>
          <h3 class="display mt-3 text-2xl">Locktime as a quiet sentry.</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-[var(--ink-2)]">
            Modern wallets set <code class="kbd">nLocktime</code> to the
            current block height on every spend. This makes high-fee
            transactions equally minable for both the current tip and any
            chain reorgs — removing the incentive for miners to "re-mine" the
            recent past to steal fees.
          </p>

          <div class="afs mt-6">
            <div class="afs__row">
              <div class="afs__step mono-readout">①</div>
              <div class="afs__body">
                <div class="afs__title">your tx</div>
                <div class="afs__sub mono-readout">nLocktime = current block height (e.g. 850123)</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="afs__row">
              <div class="afs__step mono-readout">②</div>
              <div class="afs__body">
                <div class="afs__title">miner considers reorg</div>
                <div class="afs__sub">re-mining block 850122 would <em>not</em> include your tx (locked to ≥850123)</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="afs__row">
              <div class="afs__step mono-readout">③</div>
              <div class="afs__body">
                <div class="afs__title">incentive removed</div>
                <div class="afs__sub mono-readout">→ honest mining of the tip is more profitable</div>
              </div>
            </div>
